<title>CHINA: Miramar Hotel year net up sharply.</title>
<headline>Miramar Hotel year net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   24	 vs 12.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    14.0     vs 7.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    138.59   vs 70.26</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,277.94 vs 1,143.38</p>
<p>    Company name		 Miramar Hotel and Investment Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 18-29</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   September 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Miramar Hotel engages in real estate development and investment, securities trading, hotel management and the operation of restaurants, travel agencies and car hire services.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 23 H.K. cents (including an interim dividend of nine cents) vs 12 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
